    "Operator private absolute regular non-symlink key file has closed shape. Key bytes stay transient; SQL stores only keyed digests/references and closed contexts/checkpoints. Same ID/generation with replaced key fails context/key-check validation.",
    "Independent backfill context hash includes existing mapping run and immutable high-water; restart/retry never expands range or overwrites evidence. Late User is reported rather than enrolled. Link insert failure rolls back its savepoint and leaves only fixed-code exception for explicit retry.",
    "Read-only reconciliation rechecks current digest and mapping source; source changes/rotation fail immutable match. Context reads are bounded via substr2049 and strict duplicate-key parser, explicit columns exclude added SQL fields.",
